---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Calculators: mortgage affordability, RoI, and the RERA rent-increase cap" crumbs={[{label:'Calculators'}]}>
  <h1>Calculators</h1>
  <p class="lede">Three calculators, all rule-correct and pre-filled with register data where a project page links to them.</p>
  <div class="grid2">
    <div class="card"><b><a href="/tools/mortgage/">Mortgage affordability</a></b><p class="note" style="font-size:13.5px">UAE Central Bank rules as they actually bind: LTV caps by buyer type and property count, the 50% debt-burden ratio, the salary multiple, and the age-limited tenure — and which one is your binding constraint.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><b><a href="/tools/roi/">Return on investment</a></b><p class="note" style="font-size:13.5px">Net yield after service charges, vacancy and management; levered cash-on-cash; and IRR over your hold, after true entry costs (DLD 4%, agent, mortgage fees) and exit costs.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><b><a href="/tools/rent/">Rent-increase cap (RERA)</a></b><p class="note" style="font-size:13.5px">How much a landlord can legally raise the rent at renewal, using Decree 43/2013 slabs against the average new-contract Ejari rent for your area and unit type.</p></div>
  </div>
</Base>
